 149:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       The compilation define USE_HAL_FMAC_REGISTER_CALLBACKS when set to 1
 150:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
 151:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c **** 
 152:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****     [..]
 153:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       Use Function HAL_FMAC_RegisterCallback() to register a user callback.
 154:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       Function HAL_FMAC_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
 155:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) ErrorCallback               : Error Callback.
 156:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) HalfGetDataCallback         : Get Half Data Callback.
 157:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) GetDataCallback             : Get Data Callback.
 158:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) HalfOutputDataReadyCallback : Half Output Data Ready Callback.
 159:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) OutputDataReadyCallback     : Output Data Ready Callback.
 160:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) FilterConfigCallback        : Filter Configuration Callback.
 161:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) FilterPreloadCallback       : Filter Preload Callback.
 162:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) MspInitCallback             : FMAC MspInit.
 163:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) MspDeInitCallback           : FMAC MspDeInit.
 164:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
 165:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       and a pointer to the user callback function.
 166:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c **** 
 167:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****     [..]
 168:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       Use function HAL_FMAC_UnRegisterCallback() to reset a callback to the default
 169:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       weak function.
 170:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       HAL_FMAC_UnRegisterCallback() takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle
 171:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       and the Callback ID.
 172:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       This function allows to reset following callbacks:
 173:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) ErrorCallback               : Error Callback.
 174:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) HalfGetDataCallback         : Get Half Data Callback.
 175:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) GetDataCallback             : Get Data Callback.
 176:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) HalfOutputDataReadyCallback : Half Output Data Ready Callback.
 177:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) OutputDataReadyCallback     : Output Data Ready Callback.
 178:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) FilterConfigCallback        : Filter Configuration Callback.
 179:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) FilterPreloadCallback       : Filter Preload Callback.
 180:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) MspInitCallback             : FMAC MspInit.
 181:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       (+) MspDeInitCallback           : FMAC MspDeInit.
 182:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c **** 
 183:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****     [..]
 184:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       By default, after the HAL_FMAC_Init() and when the state is HAL_FMAC_STATE_RESET
 185:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       all callbacks are set to the corresponding weak functions:
 186:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       examples GetDataCallback(), OutputDataReadyCallback().
 187:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       Exception done for MspInit and MspDeInit functions that are respectively
 188:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       reset to the legacy weak functions in the HAL_FMAC_Init()
 189:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       and HAL_FMAC_DeInit() only when these callbacks are null (not registered beforehand).
 190:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       If not, MspInit or MspDeInit are not null, the HAL_FMAC_Init() and HAL_FMAC_DeInit()
 191:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       keep and use the user MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks (registered beforehand).
 192:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c **** 
 193:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****     [..]
 194:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       Callbacks can be registered/unregistered in HAL_FMAC_STATE_READY state only.
 195:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       Exception done MspInit/MspDeInit that can be registered/unregistered
 196:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       in HAL_FMAC_STATE_READY or HAL_FMAC_STATE_RESET state, thus registered (user)
 197:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       MspInit/DeInit callbacks can be used during the Init/DeInit.
 198:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       In that case first register the MspInit/MspDeInit user callbacks
 199:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       using HAL_FMAC_RegisterCallback() before calling HAL_FMAC_DeInit()
 200:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       or HAL_FMAC_Init() function.
 201:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c **** 
 202:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****     [..]
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccxFkdJ3.s 			page 5


 203:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       When the compilation define USE_HAL_FMAC_REGISTER_CALLBACKS is set to 0 or
 204:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       not defined, the callback registration feature is not available
 205:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fmac.c ****       and weak callbacks are used.
